  "title": "Noctua: Towards Practical and Automated Fine-grained Consistency Analysis",
  "abstract": "Relaxing strong consistency plays a vital role in achieving scalability and availability for geo-replicated web applications. However, making relaxation correct in modern implementations, typically written in dynamic languages and utilizing high-level object-oriented database abstractions, remains a challenge, despite the existence of numerous proposed analysis tools.",
